{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "e58e91a0a070d35c2b37878a90d1108a1fae4b08ab2057c3e4550d8ee7784c30", "ja": "{$P$}、お願いがあります！\n少しの間、私のことを見つめてくれませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}，我有件事想拜托您！\n能请您注视我一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e8bf605611ec671b1a0f15334a3c5eeffe65a181e14a61c93217f8966dc055cd", "ja": "え？　どうしたんだ紗代子、いきなり……。", "zh": "咦？怎么了，纱代子，突然这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "6d5d1e84f941d8214fe2d354980c08be1fbcd1a6b5cb78301fe2919ddfd5b98d", "ja": "あ、すみません、説明不足で……。\nでも、見つめて欲しいのは本当なんです！", "zh": "啊，对不起，是我没解释清楚……\n但是，我确实希望你能注视着我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "1cc65fe2a83f88737c72bee8e334b192b622ad532fd9a00bb1e665e0cb1abf5e", "ja": "視線に慣れれば、恥ずかしいって気持ちも\n払拭できるかなって。それで……。", "zh": "习惯了别人的目光，也许就能消除那种不好意思的感觉。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1004_p", "source_sha256": "307c28d5e00ca3d262361c768613823e2cbccd846feb709e99ee57e9418b5965", "ja": "あ、その衣装のことか。\n設定的に、あちこちの……布がないから。", "zh": "啊，是说那套服装吗？\n从设定上来说，到处都……没有布料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "2c1ebe769983f7eb0ca4e35fa56924c28d8bc84384acffd7a4d17db9d4073b50", "ja": "はい……。もちろん、役の雰囲気には\nこれ以上ないほどピッタリだと思うんです。", "zh": "是的……我觉得，当然也再适合角色的氛围不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "406193cd1ebb0503605ded53f7eed9a0192794a8906c69fe3b73539a83ab454b", "ja": "戦った後の臨場感もあって、ダークセーラーの\n研ぎ澄まされた感じもあって。", "zh": "既有战斗后的临场感，也有黑暗水手服那种磨砺至极的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1007_p", "source_sha256": "be190a20edb3d5b6582762d8ef6d6c7f07b71f1ee15e50940b0e0c0acfafb1e3", "ja": "そうだな。それに、紗代子によく似合っていると思う。\nあとは……慣れの問題かな？", "zh": "是啊。而且我觉得这很适合紗代子。剩下的……也许只是需要习惯一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "9fbad3307f51bfb952c9af3f51f1c60cbab1e27b94fbc6391ac0ae46eb89ff31", "ja": "はい。どうしても、照れが出ちゃって……\nだから、視線に慣れるトレーニングがしたいんです。", "zh": "是的。不管怎么说，还是会忍不住害羞……\n所以，我想进行适应他人视线的训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d6336583f9560be66730664c4fb8e30bd7c41b72bc7b58eebcd233fe9b3d4b7a", "ja": "そういうことなら、協力させてもらうよ。\n紗代子のことを見つめればいいんだな？", "zh": "既然是这样，那我来帮忙吧。\n也就是说，只要一直盯着纱代子看就行了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "f745df3fbb36ee3da631ba4256dadd60d72cb7938040ce93703a29c49cbe4b98", "ja": "そうです！　あ、でもちょっと待ってください。\nふぅ……。よし！　それじゃ、お願いします。", "zh": "没错！啊，不过请稍等一下。\n呼……好！那么，就拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "0fbdc6c4f851cfc396953d01e6b01f03f1d2a62a0c013a04dd563a92dcc510d7", "ja": "ま、負けちゃダメ、負けちゃダメ……！\nでも……うう……くぅ……ダメッ……！", "zh": "不、不能认输，不能认输……！\n可是……呜呜……唔……不行了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d8ee93d87bac2635ae5b9df390401a24d29d3b4df5c9760d904a13e823b39868", "ja": "い、一旦ストップするか？　無理させてる感じで、\n何だか俺まで申し訳なくなってきた……。", "zh": "先、先停一下吧？总觉得是在勉强你，\n搞得我都觉得过意不去了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "f377d154729c1054201dc2c1d308ecb2aee5ba67915736470ea97f4c5154a125", "ja": "い、いえ、そのままお願いします！\n多少は無理しないと、壁は乗り越えられません！", "zh": "不、不用了，请继续保持原样！\n不稍微逼自己一下，是跨不过这道坎的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6df1764b8c6982c9d546e940a3d19435df09c9c0915c3ba2332338a942cb0dd7", "ja": "とはいえ、時間とともに慣れてくると思うし……。", "zh": "不过，我想随着时间推移，应该会慢慢习惯的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "873f8d3caf1f3c6ee1666d1e859f405c92f56ce8fdc3d8395cc166e732a91954", "ja": "そ、そうかもしれません。でも、ダークセーラーは、\n絶対恥ずかしがったりしないと思います。", "zh": "是、是有可能。不过，我觉得暗黑水手绝对不会害羞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "e1bfc329a465dc93f35207f444a48fed7aad49fb00869b8661fe31c84a6b91f2", "ja": "この衣装の傷は、彼女が戦った証……。たとえ操られて\nいたとしても、この服は彼女そのものなんです！", "zh": "这件服装上的伤痕，是她战斗过的证明……即使她曾被操纵过，这身衣服也就是她本人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "e77ff6a7dadf5f690b56f64e6da1c5ebc82594f78307140b75febde2c19d288a", "ja": "それを、演じる私が恥ずかしがるわけにはいきません。\nそれは彼女に、すごく失礼だと思うから……！", "zh": "饰演她的我，怎么能为此感到害羞呢。  \n因为我觉得那样对她太失礼了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c9f387b3cf5739e5011f564114405f218205d696f3826177785abe20c6e68e17", "ja": "そこまで真剣に……よし、わかった！\nなら、俺もとことん協力するよ！　一緒に頑張ろう。", "zh": "认真到这种程度……好，我明白了！\n既然如此，我也会全力配合！我们一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0624_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "3442e28e5f149f54a6af2598dde0c75bf88bf8b0319a7196c110648d649c403c", "ja": "ありがとうございます……！　一刻も早く悪に堕ちて、\n完璧なダークセーラーになれるように、頑張ります！", "zh": "谢谢您……！为了能尽早堕入邪恶，\n成为完美的暗黑水手，我会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
